<section class="vb-aff-card"><span class="eyebrow">Role-aware privacy</span><h2>Budget projections are not available to this trip role.</h2><p>Owner and Co-planner roles can work with shared affordability planning. Traveler and Viewer roles stay outside the trip budget model.</p></section>
