<article><span><?=$headroom!==null&&$headroom<0?'Over target':'Forecast headroom'?></span><strong><?=e(vb_aff_money($headroom===null?null:abs((float)$headroom),$currency))?></strong><small><?=$forecast['budget_ratio_pct']!==null?e((string)$forecast['budget_ratio_pct']).'% of target':'No target yet'?></small></article>
</section>
<div class="vb-aff-grid"><main>
<section class="vb-aff-card"><span class="eyebrow">Forecast anatomy</span><h2>What is driving the expected cost?</h2><p>Each category uses the strongest available signal: saved booking value, explicit category plan, saved live-provider estimate, or owner-only learned history. A scenario override can never reduce below a value already represented by a saved booking.</p><div class="vb-aff-table-wrap"><table class="vb-aff-table"><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Booked</th><th>Plan</th><th>Live</th><th>History</th><th>Expected</th><th>Source</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach((array)($forecast['categories']??[]) as $cat=>$row):?><tr><td><?=e((string)$row['label'])?></td><td><?=e(vb_aff_money($row['booked'],$currency))?></td><td><?=e(vb_aff_money($row['planned'],$currency))?></td><td><?=e(vb_aff_money($row['live_estimate'],$currency))?></td><td><?=$owner?e(vb_aff_money($row['history_estimate'],$currency)):'Private'?></td><td><strong><?=e(vb_aff_money($row['expected'],$currency))?></strong></td><td><?=e(vb_aff_label((string)$row['source']))?></td></tr><?php endforeach;?></tbody></table></div><div class="vb-aff-reserves"><div><span>Forecast subtotal</span><strong><?=e(vb_aff_money($forecast['forecast_subtotal']??0,$currency))?></strong></div><div><span>Contingency · <?=e((string)$forecast['contingency_pct'])?>%</span><strong><?=e(vb_aff_money($forecast['contingency']??0,$currency))?></strong></div><div><span>Disruption reserve · <?=e((string)$forecast['disruption_reserve_pct'])?>%</span><strong><?=e(vb_aff_money($forecast['disruption_reserve']??0,$currency))?></strong></div></div></section>
<section class="vb-aff-card"><span class="eyebrow">Make this trip fit my budget</span><h2>Non-destructive options first.</h2><?php if(empty($snapshot['fit_suggestions'])):?><p><?=($forecast['target_budget']??null)===null?'Set a target budget to generate budget-fit options.':'The current forecast is within the target. Vacation Brain will keep the reserve visible instead of inventing cuts.'?></p><?php else:?><div class="vb-aff-fit-list"><?php foreach($snapshot['fit_suggestions'] as $suggestion):?><article><div><strong><?=e((string)$suggestion['title'])?></strong><p><?=e((string)$suggestion['body'])?></p><small>Tradeoff: <?=e((string)$suggestion['tradeoff'])?></small></div><b>~<?=e(vb_aff_money($suggestion['estimated_savings'],$currency))?></b></article><?php endforeach;?></div><p class="vb-aff-fineprint">Savings are scenario estimates, not current provider quotes. No reservation is changed by these options.</p><?php endif;?></section>
